message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Flood Building Damage Prediction for Hurricane Harvey Using NFIP Claims, Geospatial Data, and Machine Learning (CUAHSI-NOAA Summer Institute 2024)"
abstract: >-
  Data preprocessing and an XGBoost regression model that predict the mean NFIP
  building damage amount per ZIP code for Hurricane Harvey (2017) in southeast Texas
  and southwest Louisiana from insurance-derived building attributes, NLDAS
  precipitation, terrain indices, land cover, and the Social Vulnerability
  Index. Developed during the 2024 CUAHSI-NOAA National Water Center Summer
  Institute and presented at AGU Fall Meeting 2024.
